WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,700
Xiaoyun, you are here

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:04,830
I'm a little dizzy again today

3
00:00:04,830 --> 00:00:06,830
Can you help me back to my room?

4
00:00:06,830 --> 00:00:09,540
Is the injury not completely healed yet?

5
00:00:09,540 --> 00:00:10,570
walk slower

6
00:00:10,570 --> 00:00:17,280
There is only one monitoring station nearby that is still running.

7
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:18,470
no sound

8
00:00:18,470 --> 00:00:19,470
The distance is too far

9
00:00:19,470 --> 00:00:36,200
I can only see the general process and pause it.

10
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:38,200
Go back to before the next move
